**Receipt defects and cures**

- **CP1 and Fine-1250 omit the readable-count predicate from their CONFIG companions.** Binding §2.3 requires 24 readable objects at Fine-1250. `COMP-C1250` checks stroke index and lift only, while the fixed probe checks readability. `COMP-C1000` also drops readability. Have both companions assert and print the full bound state, including the readable count. [Observe/Plan §2.3](/home/hatch/workspace/goals/diy-building-and-real-learning/hidden_files/study-jobs/recreation/runs/2026-11-18-cycle-041-wave-38/item-T238-observe-plan.md:97) · [Harness, companion predicates](/home/hatch/workspace/goals/diy-building-and-real-learning/hidden_files/study/recreations/T238-identity-collapse-pestle-mash/harness-t238.js:145)
- **F-2500, F-3500, and F-4500 print fixed times as test names.** Each test calls `stateAt` at a CONFIG-derived instant, but the receipt prints neither the evaluated instant nor a check that it equals the named source instant. File each expression and its computed value beside the raw predicate results. Execute the fixed side as well, as required by Plan §2.3’s dual form. Several other companions, including `COMP-C2750` and `COMP-C3000`, print evaluated values while the index gives only the receipt name. Add the expressions to those indexed rows. [Build record, A11 index](/home/hatch/workspace/goals/diy-building-and-real-learning/hidden_files/study/recreations/T238-identity-collapse-pestle-mash/build-record.md:116) · [Harness, intermediate probes](/home/hatch/workspace/goals/diy-building-and-real-learning/hidden_files/study/recreations/T238-identity-collapse-pestle-mash/harness-t238.js:154)
